	"name": "Multistrike",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/skills/melee/strike-blade-hooked-blue-red.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 6th level, your @UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.9De801kGPA0tzLeq]{Spellstrike} grows in power. After casting a cantrip, whether you hit or not, you may use your bonus action to strike with the residual magic left in your weapon. Treat this as a melee spell attack. On a successful hit, roll your weapon’s damage die and add your spellcasting ability modifier. This damage is of the same type as the cantrip you cast.</p><p>In addition, you may now combine spellstrike with @UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.yzRWpRozx01k3Rml]{Splitcast}, but you may only splitcast to two targets when you do so.</p>",
